<title>HUNGARY: Zwack 1996 IAS op profit HUF 952 million.</title>
<headline>Zwack 1996 IAS op profit HUF 952 million.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	     952     vs   1,025</p>
<p>    Group gross sales		 14,319     vs  12,374</p>
<p>    Consumption tax		    6,032     vs   5,438</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    8,287     vs   6,936</p>
<p>    Material costs		     4,673     vs   3,520</p>
<p>    Personnel costs		    1,124     vs     908</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   294     vs     218</p>
<p>Other operating costs and</p>
<p>	expenditures		     1,245     vs   1,265</p>
<p>    Financial revenue		     14     vs	 4</p>
<p>    Financial expenditure		437     vs     352</p>
<p>NOTE - Zwack Unicum group is a spirits maker. The figures were prepared in accordance with International Accounting Standards, they are consolidated and the 1996 are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
